<para><xrefsect id="caveats_1_caveats000103"><xreftitle>Warning</xreftitle><xrefdescription><para>This engine is not guaranteed to work if the underlying swap has a start date in the past, i.e., before today&apos;s date. When using this engine, prune the initial part of the swap so that it starts at <formula id="320">$ t \geq 0 $</formula>.</para></xrefdescription></xrefsect></para><para><xrefsect id="test_1_test000110"><xreftitle>Tests</xreftitle><xrefdescription><para>calculations are checked against cached results </para></xrefdescription></xrefsect></para>    </detaileddescription>
